#: lib/ui/screens/arena/widgets/help_dialog.dart:
msgid "The aim of this mode is to defeat enemies, score points and make your team win.\n\nThe rules are simple:\n- The players are organized into two teams.\n- Whenever a player defeats an opponent, his team scores 100 points.\n- The team that reaches the required score wins.\n\nYour teammates are the red ones.\n\nFor now it's only possible to play against CPUs.\n\nChoose the place to play and configure the game.\nWhen you are ready press \"Play\"."
msgstr "擊敗敵人、獲取分數使您的隊伍獲勝是此遊戲模式的目標。\n\n規則很簡單:\n-玩家將被分成兩組。\n-當玩家擊殺敵人，該玩家所在隊伍將獲得100點。\n-達到目標分數的團隊獲勝。\n\n您的隊友標記為紅色。\n\n目前只能跟電腦玩家對打。\n\n選擇開始的地方並配置。\n準備好後按“開始”。"

